  "notes": "**THE VALLEY v4.17.2** \u2014 Ionity Global (Pty) Ltd\n\n- **The full THE VALLEY crest on the loading screen**, with the real version under it. The title screen, footer, credits and NEWS all show **v4.17.2 SHARED BLOOD** now (one version for every screen).\n- **Every wild animal on the Fab packs:** the hyena wears the wolf, the leopard and cheetah the lioness (in their own coats), the wildebeest the Realistic Cow in its blue-grey coat, and the eagle the crow's body with real flying clips. Jackal (Fox pack) and the cows (Realistic Cow) are animated.\n- **Creeps know when they are hit:** a struck creep turns on its attacker at any range and calls its packmates within 12 m.\n",
